    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>RHEVANI</p>\n<p>Some roads are new only to the person you are today.<br>Your Speed increases by an additional 5 feet.<br>Whenever you use Past-Life Echo to select Survival, you also ignore the first 5 feet of additional movement imposed by natural difficult terrain and gain a +2-racial bonus to Sense Direction.<br>Once per day, when you Fumble a Sense Direction check, treat the result as a Failure instead.</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Sevrai heritage, Level 5</p>\n<p>Works automatically: +5 ft Speed is on your sheet; +2 racial to Sense Direction is pre-ticked while Past-Life Echo (Survival) is active; a Fumble on Sense Direction resolves as a Failure once a day (this feat's use).</p>",
